1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
This is the Wall of blacktongue.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,240
Its signature Cent, number 5185,

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,560
was struck in 1968,

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:12,480
and carries a full desert patina and a ghost.

5
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,720
The Wall holds twenty-four Cents,

6
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,520
from 1938 to 1980.

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:21,440
Among them is one of only two Cents from 1938.

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,720
And one of nine with a full gold patina.

9
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,880
That gold, with five other Cents,

10
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,200
completes a Full Spectrum Set:

11
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,680
a full verdigris, a full obsidian,

12
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,920
a full red, a full desert,

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,120
a full gold and an orange.

14
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,040
Only nine Full Spectrum Sets can exist,

15
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:42,000
as there are only nine Full Gold Cents.

16
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:46,880
On 24 October 2026, two Walls held one:

17
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,400
this Wall, and the wallet

18
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,520
of the artist, Rutherford Chang.

19
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,720
Across its Cents, the Wall also

20
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,960
covers four of the twelve contamination

21
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,760
types, which makes a Contamination Set.

